# ---- Vitis HLS generated output (regenerated on every C-sim / synthesis) ----
# Each component keeps all HLS build output in a nested <name>/<name>/ directory.
# Source (.cpp/.h), hls_config.cfg, and *_goldens/ live at the component top
# level and stay tracked.
conv1/conv1/
conv2/conv2/
LSTM/LSTM/
Relu_Max_1/Relu_Max_1/
Relu_Max_2/Relu_Max_2/
fc/fc/

# Stray per-component build files, IDE workspace state, and editor index caches
**/*.hlscompile_summary
**/dfx_runtime.txt
**/.cache/
_ide/
.vitisWorkspace.json